@startuml

title DealFit - Current-State Sponsorship Screening Workflow (Before DealFit)

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #4A5568
  FontColor #1A202C
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF4CC
  DiamondBorderColor #B7791F
}
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568

|Brand / Platform|
start
:Send sponsorship pitch through\nEmail / DM / Creator Marketplace;

|Creator|
:Open and read the pitch;
:Manually identify brand, compensation,\ndeliverables and campaign requirements;

if (Basic information complete?) then (Yes)
else (No)
  :Request missing information\nfrom brand/contact;
  |Brand / Platform|
  :Provide clarification or\nadditional deal details;
  |Creator|
endif

:Check category against personal\npreferences and exclusions;

if (Hard conflict with creator rules?) then (Yes)
  :Decline opportunity;
  :Optionally record decision\nin notes/spreadsheet;
  stop
else (No)
endif

:Assess niche and likely\naudience relevance;
:Compare compensation with\ndeliverables and personal benchmarks;
:Review exclusivity, usage rights\nand campaign obligations;

|External Information Sources|
:Search brand information,\nreputation or prior context if needed;
:Review previous deal records,\nnotes or informal benchmarks;

|Creator|
:Combine commercial, audience, brand\nand personal-context signals manually;

if (Is the opportunity clearly suitable?) then (Yes)
  :Accept or proceed to\ncommercial discussion;
elseif (Potential value but terms need change?) then (Negotiate)
  :Negotiate compensation, deliverables\nor contract terms;
elseif (Clearly unsuitable?) then (Decline)
  :Decline opportunity;
else (Uncertain)
  :Request more information or\nperform additional manual review;
endif

:Optionally record final decision\nand supporting notes;
stop

@enduml
